<td id="S4.T7.5.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">0.7328</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T7.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T7.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">fine-tune on gen + real</th>
